    "updated_at": "2022-10-17T22:24:47Z",
    "body": "As far as bikeshedding the API is concerned, I would likely prefer something more like:\r\n\r\n```js\r\nURL.test(input[, base]);\r\n```\r\n\r\nWith the semantics specifically only limited to: Will this parse successfully.",
